^(/[^ ]* )?\$ dock run --name w writer$
^writer: motd: Welcome to ruos\.$
^writer: count 1$
^writer: / has bin, data, etc; /etc has 0 entries$
^\[w exited with 0\]$
^(/[^ ]* )?\$ dock commit w snap$
^committed snap:latest [0-9a-f]{12} \(2 files, 1 removed\)$
^writer: no /etc/motd$
^writer: count 2$
^\[snap-[0-9]+ exited with 0\]$
^(/[^ ]* )?\$ dock push snap$
